<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Knights still in talks, advises caution.</title>
<headline>Knights still in talks, advises caution.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Knights Gold Mining Company said on Friday talks referred to in an earlier cautionary were continuing satisfactorily.</p>
<p>On July 1, the company said it was in talks with Randgold &amp; Exploration Company Ltd on the formation of a new company Newco which would be listed on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The talks also involved the acquisition by Newco of Knight's assets and RMP Properties Ltd's land clearing and gold recovery operations.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to continue to exercice caution in their sharedealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
